截任务。把防线焊死，别让那台车越线半步。","dur":4.52,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/a04.wav"},"b01":{"text":"第二回合。检查一下战车，准备再来一轮。","dur":3.15,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/b01.wav"},"b01c":{"text":"第二回合，刚才那把是热身，现在动真格的！","dur":3.89,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/b01c.wav"},"b01b":{"text":"第三回合，比分咬得很紧，打起精神！","dur":2.62,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/b01b.wav"},"b02":{"text":"决胜局来了。赢下这把，我自掏腰包请全队喝咖啡。","dur":4.09,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/b02.wav"},"b02b":{"text":"最后一局了，全力以赴！","dur":2.03,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/b02b.wav"},"b03":{"text":"大门开启，冲出去，给他们点颜色瞧瞧。","dur":2.84,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/b03.wav"},"b03b":{"text":"出发，让他们见识见识咱们的手艺！","dur":2.69,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/b03b.wav"},"b03c":{"text":"油门踩到底，冲啊！","dur":2.68,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/b03c.wav"},"b04":{"text":"拿下这回合，打得漂亮。","dur":1.87,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/b04.wav"},"b04b":{"text":"这回合赢了，继续保持！","dur":1.86,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/b04b.wav"},"b04c":{"text":"这回合拿下了，对面脸都黑了！","dur":2.9,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/b04c.wav"},"b05":{"text":"这回合丢了，回去把车补好，下把找回来。","dur":2.95,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/b05.wav"},"b05b":{"text":"这回合丢了，没事，下回合拿回来。","dur":2.73,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/b05b.wav"},"b05c":{"text":"可惜，差一点，下回合再来！","dur":3.04,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/b05c.wav"},"b06":{"text":"居然打平了，两边准备加赛。","dur":2.34,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/b06.wav"},"b06b":{"text":"打平了，谁也没占到便宜。","dur":2.18,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/b06b.wav"},"b07":{"text":"决胜时刻，维修系统离线，掉的方块可长不回来了。","dur":4.01,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/b07.wav"},"b07b":{"text":"决胜时刻，修不了车了，每块方块都得省着用！","dur":3.91,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/b07b.wav"},"b08":{"text":"最后一分钟，压过去。","dur":1.56,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/b08.wav"},"b08b":{"text":"还剩一分钟，加把劲！","dur":1.75,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/b08b.wav"},"b09":{"text":"最后三十秒，速战速决。","dur":2.08,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/b09.wav"},"b09b":{"text":"三十秒，最后冲一波！","dur":1.95,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/b09b.wav"},"b10":{"text":"进入加时，谁先松手谁请客，顶住。","dur":3.36,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/b10.wav"},"b10b":{"text":"加时赛，谁也别松手！","dur":1.99,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/b10b.wav"},"c01":{"text":"开张啦！第一台，漂亮！","dur":2.42,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/c01.wav"},"c01c":{"text":"首单到手，开门红！","dur":2.15,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/c01c.wav"},"c02":{"text":"咱们先掉了一台，稳住别慌。","dur":2.09,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/c02.wav"},"c01b":{"text":"哎呀，被对面抢先了，没事，咱们找回来！","dur":3.58,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/c01b.wav"},"c03a":{"text":"拆得好，对面车炸了。","dur":1.81,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/c03a.wav"},"c03b":{"text":"又报废一台，记你账上。","dur":1.84,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/c03b.wav"},"c03c":{"text":"漂亮，又少一台！","dur":1.71,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/c03c.wav"},"c03d":{"text":"打得好，对面那台散成一地方块了。","dur":2.74,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/c03d.wav"},"c03e":{"text":"又一台趴下了！","dur":1.01,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/c03e.wav"},"c03f":{"text":"送他回机库喝咖啡吧！","dur":1.59,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/c03f.wav"},"c04":{"text":"一口气两台，可以啊你！","dur":2.41,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/c04.wav"},"c04b":{"text":"又一台！今天手感挺热啊！","dur":2.75,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/c04b.wav"},"c05b":{"text":"三台了！对面已经开始慌了！","dur":3.15,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/c05b.wav"},"c05":{"text":"停不下来了！这个月优秀员工非你莫属！","dur":3.73,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/c05.wav"},"c05c":{"text":"还在拆！对面都快哭出来了！","dur":2.83,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/c05c.wav"},"c06":{"text":"队友的车散架了，注意侧翼。","dur":2.02,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/c06.wav"},"c06b":{"text":"队友倒了一台，别落单。","dur":1.65,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/c06b.wav"},"c06c":{"text":"又倒了一个队友，大家抱团走！","dur":2.22,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/c06c.wav"},"c07":{"text":"对面就剩一台独苗了，围上去拆了他。","dur":2.95,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/c07.wav"},"c07b":{"text":"只剩最后一台了，别让他跑了！","dur":2.22,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/c07b.wav"},"c07c":{"text":"最后一台了，收网！","dur":1.83,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/c07c.wav"},"c08":{"text":"全队就剩你一台车了，机修师，看你的了。","dur":3.25,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/c08.wav"},"c08b":{"text":"就剩你了，撑住，我在这边给你加油！","dur":3.25,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/c08b.wav"},"c09c":{"text":"哎呀，车被拆了，换台新的再来。","dur":3.04,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/c09c.wav"},"c10":{"text":"你的车变成一堆方块了，坐下喝杯咖啡，看队友打吧。","dur":4.46,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/c10.wav"},"c10b":{"text":"出局了，在旁边给队友喊加油吧。","dur":2.69,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/c10b.wav"},"c11":{"text":"新车到了，油门踩到底，找他们算账去！","dur":3.43,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/c11.wav"},"c11b":{"text":"新车到了，这次可别再散架了。","dur":2.28,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/c11b.wav"},"d01A":{"text":"正在占领A点，站稳了别动。","dur":2.19,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d01A.wav"},"d02A":{"text":"A点打起来了，上去踩一脚！","dur":2.07,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d02A.wav"},"d03A":{"text":"A点拿下了，干得好！","dur":1.66,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d03A.wav"},"d03A2":{"text":"A点又回到咱们手里了！","dur":1.59,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d03A2.wav"},"d04A":{"text":"糟糕，A点被对面抢走了。","dur":2.17,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d04A.wav"},"d04A2":{"text":"A点被抢了，谁离得近去看看。","dur":2.19,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d04A2.wav"},"d01B":{"text":"B点进度在涨，再坚持一下！","dur":2.19,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d01B.wav"},"d02B":{"text":"B点有人在抢，快去支援！","dur":1.96,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d02B.wav"},"d03B":{"text":"B点到手，漂亮！","dur":2.05,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d03B.wav"},"d03B2":{"text":"B点抢回来了，漂亮！","dur":1.69,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d03B2.wav"},"d04B":{"text":"哎呀，B点丢了，快抢回来！","dur":2.07,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d04B.wav"},"d04B2":{"text":"B点没守住，快回去支援！","dur":1.98,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d04B2.wav"},"d01C":{"text":"C点占领中，守住这个圈！","dur":2.26,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d01C.wav"},"d02C":{"text":"C点开打了，别让他们得逞！","dur":2.29,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d02C.wav"},"d03C":{"text":"C点也归咱们了，舒服！","dur":2,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d03C.wav"},"d03C2":{"text":"C点稳了，干得好！","dur":1.78,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d03C2.wav"},"d04C":{"text":"C点没了，对面这手够阴的。","dur":2.62,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d04C.wav"},"d04C2":{"text":"C点丢了，对面人都往那边去了。","dur":2.45,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d04C2.wav"},"d05":{"text":"对面老家护盾破了，快去把他们反应堆里的能源偷光！","dur":3.61,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d05.wav"},"d05b":{"text":"对面护盾没了，反应堆敞着呢，快去偷！","dur":3.1,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d05b.wav"},"d06":{"text":"咱们家护盾掉了，快回防反应堆！","dur":2.37,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d06.wav"},"d06b":{"text":"家里护盾灭了，有人在偷咱们的分，快回去！","dur":3.27,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d06b.wav"},"d07":{"text":"偷到了，哎呀这招可真损，我喜欢。","dur":3.98,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d07.wav"},"d07b":{"text":"又偷到一笔，这买卖划算！","dur":2.23,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d07b.wav"},"d08b":{"text":"进度过半了，别松劲！","dur":1.6,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d08b.wav"},"d08":{"text":"进度百分之七十五了，稳住，马上能下班了。","dur":3.8,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d08.wav"},"d09":{"text":"对面快满了，别摸鱼了，赶紧抢点！","dur":3.05,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d09.wav"},"d09b":{"text":"对面进度涨得飞快，再不抢点就来不及了！","dur":3.57,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d09b.wav"},"d10":{"text":"咱们家护盾回来了，反应堆安全了！","dur":2.6,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d10.wav"},"d10b":{"text":"护盾重新上线，家里稳住了。","dur":2.26,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d10b.wav"},"d11":{"text":"对面护盾又亮了，偷分时间结束。","dur":3.06,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d11.wav"},"d11b":{"text":"对面护盾回来了，先撤出来。","dur":1.98,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/d11b.wav"},"e01":{"text":"车动了，跟紧点，这玩意可没长眼睛。","dur":2.95,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/e01.wav"},"e01b":{"text":"车又动起来了，护好它！","dur":1.61,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/e01b.wav"},"e02":{"text":"车停了，清掉周围的敌人！","dur":2.08,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/e02.wav"},"e02b":{"text":"车被卡住了，把旁边的家伙清掉！","dur":2.34,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/e02b.wav"},"e03":{"text":"突破检查点，加时到手，战线前移！","dur":3.42,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/e03.wav"},"e03b":{"text":"又过一个检查点，复活点跟上来了！","dur":2.64,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/e03b.wav"},"e03c":{"text":"检查点到手，复活点往前挪了！","dur":2.63,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/e03c.wav"},"e04":{"text":"就差一百米！推上去，推到底！","dur":2.91,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/e04.wav"},"e04b":{"text":"就差一百米了，推上去！","dur":2.04,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/e04b.wav"},"e05":{"text":"攻守换边，现在轮到我们当拦路虎了。","dur":3.04,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/e05.wav"},"e10":{"text":"攻守换边，这回轮到咱们推车了！","dur":2.81,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/e10.wav"},"e06":{"text":"货物安全到站，收工，非常完美！","dur":3.17,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/e06.wav"},"e06b":{"text":"到站了，这单送得漂亮！","dur":2.16,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/e06b.wav"},"e07":{"text":"时间到，看看咱们推了多远。","dur":2.86,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/e07.wav"},"e07b":{"text":"时间到了，车就停在这儿了。","dur":2.12,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/e07b.wav"},"e08":{"text":"对面开始推车了，快去拦住它！","dur":2.53,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/e08.wav"},"e08b":{"text":"对面车动了，别让它往前走！","dur":2.01,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/e08b.wav"},"e09":{"text":"对面的车到站了，这半场没守住。","dur":4,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/e09.wav"},"e09b":{"text":"对面送到站了，可惜。","dur":2.01,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/e09b.wav"},"e11":{"text":"车被咱们拦住了，守得好，别让它再动！","dur":3.53,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/e11.wav"},"e11b":{"text":"拦住了，就这样卡死它！","dur":1.96,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/e11b.wav"},"f01":{"text":"大获全胜，战损全部公司报销，今晚食堂加鸡腿！","dur":4.48,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/f01.wav"},"f01b":{"text":"赢了，今天这把能写进简历了！","dur":2.39,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/f01b.wav"},"f02":{"text":"输了，回机库捡方块吧，这星期的奖金全泡汤了。","dur":5.48,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/f02.wav"},"f02b":{"text":"输了，没关系，方块还能再拼。","dur":3,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/f02b.wav"},"f03":{"text":"平局，打了半天两手空空，老板脸都绿了。","dur":4.42,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/f03.wav"},"f03b":{"text":"平局，下次再分个高下吧。","dur":2.42,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/f03b.wav"},"f03c":{"text":"平局，两边都没占到便宜，下回再来。","dur":3.34,"path":"Sounds/BattleRadio/f03c.wav"}}}